","stargazers":0,"master_branch":"main"},"pusher":{"name":"jobfynder-admin","email":"jobfynder.com@gmail.com"},"forced":false,"sender":{"login":"jobfynder-admin","id":213675935,"node_id":"U_kgDODLxvnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213675935?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin","html_url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created":true,"deleted":false,"base_ref":null,"compare":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-FE-vite/commit/f967546d14fa","commits":[{"id":"f967546d14fa05fcc6ba17b3a4ace4f8cfba0601","tree_id":"f71b044e83a0ee6826ad2bfc402aa663f7d8cb6e","distinct":true,"message":"feat(job-tracker): role-based Job Tracker on the Core API\n\nOne route, one page per role, all data from the Core Job Tracker API\n(jobFynder-BE-nestJS `src/job-tracker`, PRs #19/#20). The hardcoded arrays,\nthe copied Pulse/Messenger/resume tabs and the seven-tab detail page are gone.\n\nPages (named from the launch persona navigation)\n- consultant  -> \"My Applications\": tracked jobs (add, move, notes, remove) +\n  \"Submitted for me\" (read-only, from /bench/submissions/mine). No rates,\n  margin or recruiter-desk data.\n- bench_sales -> \"My Submissions\": four stat cards that are real filters,\n  stage chips, search/sort, one-click \"move forward\" on every row.\n- recruiter   -> \"Job Tracker\": my jobs with real per-stage counts; the drawer\n  lists who was submitted (name, stage, dates only).\n- employer / others: an \"isn't available yet\" page; the nav item is hidden.\n\nBehaviour\n- Detail is a side drawer (per ui-conventions), deep-linkable at\n  /job-tracker-board/:id. A consultant deep link that is a submission id\n  switches to \"Submitted for me\" automatically.\n- Everything is server-side: filters, search, sort and paging live in the URL;\n  counts on chips and cards come from the API and equal the list you get on click.\n- Stages come from the two frozen lifecycles; \"Awaiting reply\", \"Follow up\"\n  etc. are flags, never stages. SCREENING shows as Submitted + sub-stage.\n- Skeleton rows, empty (first-use vs filtered) and error-with-retry states on\n  every list.\n- Bench drawer: stage + interview/offer dates, Activity timeline and open\n  follow-ups, six-item readiness checklist (persisted).\n- Rate / margin / match / SLA are not shown (no backend fields yet).\n- Recruiter \"Add candidates\" stays hidden behind VITE_TRACKER_ADD_CANDIDATES;\n  the conversation section behind VITE_TRACKER_MESSAGES_ENABLED.\n- Header nav: tracker limited to consultant / bench_sales / recruiter and named\n  per role.\n\nRemoved: constants/{job-tracker,jobTrackerBoard,benchSalesTableData}.ts,\ntypes/{job-tracker,bench-sales-table}.ts, hooks/useJobTrackerTabs.ts and 56\nunused components under private/job-tracker{,-detail}. Kept: the two\nAdd-candidate modals (flagged) and FilterPulseFeed (used elsewhere).\n\nVerification: tsc (only the 4 errors that exist on dev-duplicate remain),\neslint 0 errors, `react-router build` OK; exercised in a browser against a mock\nof the API for all four roles (filters, paging, one-click moves, drawer,\nchecklist, add/duplicate/validation, deep links, skeleton, empty, error+retry).\nNOT verified against the real backend (PR #19/#20 are not deployed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-20T17:09:57-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-FE-vite/commit/f967546d14fa05fcc6ba17b3a4ace4f8cfba0601","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-20T17:09:57-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-20T17:09:57-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["src/features/job-tracker/components/AddRecordDialog.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/components/ChecklistPanel.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/components/ListStates.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/components/ListToolbar.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/components/PaginationBar.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/components/StageChips.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/components/SummaryCards.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/components/Timeline.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/components/TrackerDrawer.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/components/TrackerShell.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/drawers/JobDrawer.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/drawers/MySubmissionDrawer.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/drawers/RecordDrawer.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/drawers/SubmissionDrawer.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/format.ts","src/features/job-tracker/jobTrackerApi.ts","src/features/job-tracker/pages/MyApplicationsPage.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/pages/MySubmissionsPage.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/pages/RecruiterJobTrackerPage.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/pages/TrackerUnavailable.tsx","src/features/job-tracker/stages.ts","src/features/job-tracker/types.ts","src/features/job-tracker/useListParams.ts"],"removed":["src/components/components/private/job-tracker-detail/ActivityTab.tsx","src/components/components/private/job-tracker-detail/AddCommentDrawer.tsx","src/components/components/private/job-tracker-detail/AddEvaluationDrawer.tsx","src/components/c